{"nodes": [{"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "label": "v2 model contracts: the structured I/O at every model touchpoint (tagger, interpreter, embedder), inherited invariants, deliberately-absent contracts, and the sign-off checklist of judgment calls.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_three_touchpoints", "label": "A model touches an item in exactly three places \u2014 tagger (build, per chunk), interpreter (query, per prompt), embedder (build+query, per phrase) \u2014 everything else is deterministic and free.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_inherited_invariants", "label": "Every contract inherits: no numbers cross the model boundary either direction; stateless temp-0 one-call-per-unit; schema-enforced output that fails loud; one shared async rate limiter; vocab-free model contexts.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_tagger_contract", "label": "The tagger contract: one temp-0 call per chunk over a chunk-envelope, emitting open contextual-phrase lists (topic/process/stance) plus closed-enum chunk attributes (function/temporal_stance), source-language, no numbers.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_interpreter_contract", "label": "The interpreter contract: one toolless temp-0 call per prompt emitting literals (kind+polarity), prompt-side facet phrases, a structural date_range, and answer_shape \u2014 extracting exactly the axes retrieval uses, no coefficients.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_embedder_contract", "label": "The embedder contract: the asymmetric nv-embedqa-1b-v2 embeds exactly one thing \u2014 phrase tags (passage) and their prompt-side facet mirror (query) \u2014 at native 2048 dims, L2-normalized, under the shared limiter.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_must_not_appear", "label": "MUST-NOT rule: ids, dates/years, URLs, PR numbers, and channel ids never appear in tagger output \u2014 those are facts that become structure (the v1 pollution); enforced as promptfoo regression assertions with no model in the loop.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_closed_enums_are_attributes", "label": "Closed-facet labels (function, temporal_stance, literal kind, answer_shape) are chunk attributes or universal enums living in the fixed prompt \u2014 never embedded \u2014 while open facets are the only thing the pipeline ever embeds.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_deliberately_absent", "label": "Deliberately absent: no answerer/generation contract (specced with the eval harness), no LLM-judge (died with the description carrier), and no per-dataset prompt variants (one tagger + one interpreter prompt).", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_schema_revalidation", "label": "Status: the verbally-approved tagger output schema predates the 2026-06-14 facet reframe (facets = relevance channels, same-facet matching), so per-facet carriers are REOPENED and must be re-validated before encoding.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_signoff_checklist", "label": "The sign-off checklist: each judgment call beyond decided design (per-facet carriers, marked spans, context envelope, native dims, answer_shape, current date) is asked in conversation with its schema inline \u2014 the doc itself is never the approval.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_three_touchpoints", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_inherited_invariants", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_tagger_contract", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_interpreter_contract", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_embedder_contract", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_must_not_appear", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_closed_enums_are_attributes", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_deliberately_absent", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_schema_revalidation", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_signoff_checklist", "target": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_tagger_contract", "target": "2026_05_31_v2_artefact_rebuild_and_facet_design_v2_facet_set", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_model_contracts_must_not_appear", "target": "2026_05_31_v2_artefact_rebuild_and_facet_design_retag_facet_analysis", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "v3/artefact/MODEL_CONTRACTS.md", "weight": 1.0}]}